(1) This chapter shall be applicable to all land development, including, but not limited to, site plan applications, subdivision applications, and grading applications, unless eligible for an exemption or granted a waiver by the city and/or its designee. These standards apply to any new development or redevelopment site that meets one or more of the following criteria:
